Grab a target and teleport it to your side or if adjacent up to 6 spaces away from you, pinning it there with a bone rising from the ground for [4, 5, 6, 7, 8 (TL1-5)] turns.

The bone will also deal [83, 112, 135, 154, 171 (TL1-5; SP 100)] physical damage.

The damage will increase with your Spellpower.
